WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,960
Bring the tea shop to life

2
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:02,880
This is a coffee I am selling now

3
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:04,400
I am the only one in the whole Jiangcheng who has the goods

4
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:12,400
Try it first and then spread it out. It tastes good.

5
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:14,120
I've never tasted this before

6
00:00:15,550 --> 00:00:16,910
How much do you plan to sell a bottle for?

7
00:00:17,110 --> 00:00:18,070
I sell it myself for thirty

8
00:00:18,470 --> 00:00:20,150
The purchase price for you is twenty

9
00:00:20,870 --> 00:00:21,830
How much do you say

10
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:23,520
Don't decide in a hurry

11
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:24,960
I leave this food to you

12
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:27,200
Failed to sell or have no repeat customers

13
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:28,280
Just think of it as a gift from me

14
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:30,120
If you need goods, come to me

15
00:00:35,150 --> 00:00:37,230
Boss, do you want to sell this?

16
00:00:37,630 --> 00:00:39,630
Sell it for free anyway

17
00:00:39,710 --> 00:00:41,910
If we can’t sell it, we’ll drink it ourselves and we won’t lose anything.
